This project is an independent rewrite, in Rust, of the "bb-cli" Bitbucket
command-line client originally written in PHP and distributed under the MIT
License. No PHP source from that project remains here, but this project began
as a fork of it and its command surface and behaviour were the starting point
for this implementation.

